2. `openhuman-full` is a product stack, not a grab-bag; three of its crates carry capabilities neither the plan nor the §13 skip list covers, and all 21 are GPL-3.0.
3. Three of the ten repos are GPL-3.0. The plan's own V9 line-comparison copy check is better than anything in the references, but the clean-room rule is trapped in phase 003 and never reaches phase 011, whose primary reference is `tinychannels`.
